note right of SphericalGeodesicCalculator
  **Forward Azimuth Formula:**
  y = sin(Δλ) * cos(φ2)
  x = cos(φ1)*sin(φ2) - sin(φ1)*cos(φ2)*cos(Δλ)
  θ = atan2(y, x) normalized to [0, 2π)
  **Tangent Plane Normal:**
  n_ij = (sin θ, cos θ) = (uEast, vNorth)
end note

note bottom of SpatialMonad
  **Thermodynamic Guardrails:**
  First Law: Σ Φ_ij = Σ Φ_ji (machine ε < 1e-14)
  Second Law: dS_total/dt = Σ Φ_heat * (1/T_j - 1/T_i) ≥ 0
end note

